p / P           Paste after / before cursor

To copy to Mac clipboard (Terminal.app):
  1. Press Space m      to disable mouse capture
  2. Select text with mouse
  3. Cmd+C              to copy
  4. Press Space m      to re-enable mouse

To paste from Mac clipboard:
  - In insert mode, just Cmd+V (terminal sends it as keystrokes)
  - Or: enter insert mode (i), then Cmd+V

Alternative: hold Option while dragging to select (bypasses mouse
capture without toggling). Then Cmd+C to copy.

